@startuml
title v0002-state-registry - historical record topology

participant "Caller" as Caller
participant "State Registry" as State
database "State Registry DB" as Db
participant "Scheduler" as Scheduler
participant "Env Registry" as Env

Caller -> State : write events / controls, read history
State -> Db : persist task records, events, audit, controls
State -x Scheduler : forbidden scheduling call
State -x Env : forbidden env/secret call

@enduml
